# Simplified Chinese translations the port wrote where upstream has none.
#
# Upstream's zh-CN resources cover only part of the strings the port uses, and the
# port adds controls of its own. The project owner translated the rest. The importer
# (`cargo xtask import-upstream-locales`) merges this file into the zh-CN catalogue
# and marks every row from it `#. d4lc translation, not from upstream`.
#
# Terms follow the upstream zh-CN resources and the zh-CN game data under
# assets/original/data: 词缀 affix, 威能 aspect, 符印 sigil, 符文 rune, 暗金 unique,
# 巅峰 paragon, 覆盖 overlay, 预设 preset, 淬炼 tempered, 强效 greater, 灵巫 Spiritborn.
#
# An entry here must not repeat a string upstream already translates, and every
# string without an upstream zh-CN value needs one.
